    <h1 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl lg:text-[28px] font-semibold text-ink tracking-tight mt-0 mb-4 leading-tight text-balance">
        Why Some Image URLs Won't Download Directly
    </h1>

    <AuthorByline publishDate="2026-09-27" />

    <div class="rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-warning-soft text-warning text-sm px-5 py-4 my-6" role="note">
        <strong>Update:</strong> PasteDownloadApp's URL download feature has been discontinued and is no longer available in the tool. This article is kept for reference. The CORS and hotlink-protection behavior described below still applies to any browser-based tool that tries to fetch images from arbitrary URLs.
    </div>

